Then the area of the ellipse is
\[\pi \cdot \frac{v^2}{2g} \cdot \frac{v^2}{4g} = \frac{\pi}{8} \cdot \frac{v^4}{g^2}.\]Thus, $c = \boxed{\frac{\pi}{8}}.$

